    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to a home that offers the perfect balance of sophistication and practicality. Situated within the exclusive new development \"Hettyfield Gardens\", in one of Douglas' most sought-after residential areas, this exceptional newly constructed four-bedroom detached home (176.5sqm) offers spacious light filled accomodation with exceptional convenience. \r\n\r\nNo.7 Hettyfield Gardens is finished to a builders finish currently - ie no flooring, tiling or fitted furniture. The photos herein are of 8 Hettyfield Gardens, which is of the same layout. The asking price of No.7 includes a PC Sum of €20,000. \r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\nUpon entering this home, you are greeted by a light-filled hallway that sets the tone for the elegant interiors throughout. The spacious living room, with large picture windows, offers a warm and inviting space for relaxation.\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and family room area is the heart of the home. Double doors lead to a pleasant rear garden, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor living experience. An invaluable utility room accessed off the kitchen, has plumbing for washing machine and dryer.\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises four well-proportioned bedrooms, over two floors. The principal suite to the top floor features a luxurious en-suite shower room and walk in wardrobe area. Two further bedrooms are ensuite and together offers flexibility as an ideal home office, study, or creative space. A stylish main bathroom completes the upper-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nLOCATION\r\nDouglas is one of Cork's most desirable residential areas, offering an excellent blend of urban convenience and suburban tranquillity. Residents enjoy proximity to renowned schools, boutique shopping, award-winning restaurants, and recreational amenities. The city centre is within easy reach, while excellent transport links make commuting effortless.\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a luxury home in a prime setting, combining modern elegance with everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n> Prime location in an exclusive small development in Douglas, Cork\r\n> Overall floor area of approx. 176.5sqm / 1,900sqft \r\n> Energy-efficient construction with BER A2\r\n> New Home with 10 year homebond Guarantee.\r\n> Spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/family room area with direct garden access\r\n> Four bedrooms, with flexibility as a home office or study\r\n> Luxurious principal bedroom with en-suite and walk in wardrobe\r\n> Private rear garden, with side gates and private driveway parking\r\n> Moments from Douglas village with boutique shopping, fine dining, and excellent schools\r\n> Easy access to Cork City and major transport links"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Large detached new build home.\r\n- PC Sum included in price\r\n- Exceptional location in one of Cork's premier addresses, Hettyfield."
      },
